py":-0.1141,"r5_spy":-0.0458,"r20_spy":0.0721,"r1_sector":-0.1165,"r5_sector":-0.0642,"r20_sector":-0.0069,"etf":"XLK"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2025-06-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"This really highlights the accelerating investments in AI infrastructure and our leadership in addressing this demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2025-06-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"Indeed, three of our top five customers this quarter were cloud providers, underscoring their sustained investments in AI expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2025-06-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jim Moylan","x":"Adjusted gross margin was 41%, in line with our guidance, driven by product mix and, to a lesser extent, the cost of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2025-06-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jim Moylan","x":"During the quarter, we navigated a new and, in the early days, a rapidly changing US SAP tariff environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2025-06-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Moylan","x":"Some cases, it might result in some price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2025-06-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Moylan","x":"General price increases, etc. So all of those things, that is about as far as we are willing to go today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2025-06-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"We recently worked with a global cloud provider to co-develop a solution based on our existing technologies, designed to significantly reduce the complexities of these networks and streamline the management of its large-scale data center operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2025-06-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott McFeely","x":"So it has the same dynamic as the pluggables, lots of levers to pull on, you know, operational supply chain efficiencies and design cost reduction that you do over the life cycle of a product, and that will naturally lift the margins in those parts of the portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2025-06-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Tim Savageaux","x":"And congrats on the results and increased outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2025-09-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"At a strategic level, for cloud providers to monetize their substantial AI investments in LLM and GPUs and related data center infrastructure, they need to invest in the network infrastructure that interconnect data centers or they risk stranding their massive investments.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/550667411/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/Transcript-Cienas-Fiscal-Third-Quarter-2025-Financial-Results-Conference-Call.pdf"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2025-09-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"Our portfolio, as you know, including WaveLogic Technologies, the RLS platform, the Navigator Domain Controller and our Interconnect Solutions continue to be recognized as the industry standard for AI network infrastructure, solidifying our role as a critical enabler in this transformation.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/550667411/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/Transcript-Cienas-Fiscal-Third-Quarter-2025-Financial-Results-Conference-Call.pdf"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2025-09-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Marc Graff","x":"Adjusted gross margin in Q3 was 41.9%, 90 basis points above our guidance, primarily driven by benefits from sales of previously reserved material and lower net tariff impacts.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/550667411/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/Transcript-Cienas-Fiscal-Third-Quarter-2025-Financial-Results-Conference-Call.pdf"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2025-09-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Marc Graff","x":"Before I get to guidance, let me provide a brief update on tariffs.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/550667411/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/Transcript-Cienas-Fiscal-Third-Quarter-2025-Financial-Results-Conference-Call.pdf"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2025-09-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"George Notter","x":"And do you see some opportunities to be more firm on price or even raise price as the market kind of coalesces around two vendors or even just Ciena?","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/550667411/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/Transcript-Cienas-Fiscal-Third-Quarter-2025-Financial-Results-Conference-Call.pdf"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2025-09-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"George Notter","x":"In terms of value exchange, I assume you're talking about the potential for raising price or being firmer on price.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/550667411/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/Transcript-Cienas-Fiscal-Third-Quarter-2025-Financial-Results-Conference-Call.pdf"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2025-09-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"We codeveloped this solution with a hyperscaler, which allows them to streamline the installation and management of its large-scale data center operations, improving scalability and reducing power and space.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/550667411/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/Transcript-Cienas-Fiscal-Third-Quarter-2025-Financial-Results-Conference-Call.pdf"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2025-09-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marc Graff","x":"This will result in a Q4 restructuring expense of approximately $20 million to cover employee severance and related costs, expected to be paid starting in Q4 and additionally adjusted out from our GAAP reported earnings.","url":"https://s25.q4cdn.com/550667411/files/doc_financials/2025/q3/Transcript-Cienas-Fiscal-Third-Quarter-2025-Financial-Results-Conference-Call.pdf"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q4","e":"cien","d":"2025-12-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"As counterintuitive as it may seem, the cloud providers have largely actually underinvested in their networks to date, particularly relative to other areas of AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/ciena-cien-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q4","e":"cien","d":"2025-12-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"These cloud providers cannot and do not intend to strand their significant investments in AI-related data center infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/ciena-cien-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2025 Q4","e":"cien","d":"2025-12-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Graff","x":"We continue to mitigate most of the impacts of tariffs, as we are currently constructed, and the net impact of tariffs is immaterial to our bottom line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/ciena-cien-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q1","e":"cien","d":"2026-03-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"In fact, we are taking meaningful share of the increase in AI-driven connectivity spend as customers trust our technology leadership, deep collaboration, and proven execution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/ciena-cien-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q1","e":"cien","d":"2026-03-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"It is also increasingly fueled by the rise of large-scale AI data centers that need to be interconnected with DCI solutions, linking data centers across campuses, regions, and continents.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/ciena-cien-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q1","e":"cien","d":"2026-03-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Graff","x":"Before I discuss our Q2 and updated 2026 outlook, I would like to make a few comments on tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/ciena-cien-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q1","e":"cien","d":"2026-03-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Graff","x":"As you know, on February 20, the Supreme Court struck down the IEPA tariffs originally implemented in March 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/ciena-cien-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q1","e":"cien","d":"2026-03-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Graff","x":"You mentioned price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/ciena-cien-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q1","e":"cien","d":"2026-03-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Graff","x":"One of the things that we are trying to do is really balance the price increases with our share position in the market, and I think what you have seen is we have been able to increase our gross margin as well as increase our share, and so I think we are doing a really good job of balancing those…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/ciena-cien-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q1","e":"cien","d":"2026-03-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott McFeely","x":"I think on the cost reduction piece, I think of it as three levers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/ciena-cien-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q1","e":"cien","d":"2026-03-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott McFeely","x":"The third piece, and we did not talk a lot about it, it is not all on the lines that you said where we are depending more on the EMSs, but we are constantly looking at that supply chain design, the whole ecosystem design, and trying to optimize that to get cost out of it as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/05/ciena-cien-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2026-06-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Simon Leopold","x":"I'm wondering, one, are you able to raise price in the backlog?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2026-06-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Simon Leopold","x":"And how does your price hike factor into your growth?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2026-06-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Marc Graff","x":"We are navigating these challenges well as evidenced by our strong performance and ability to increase our outlook over the past couple of quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q2","e":"cien","d":"2026-06-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Marc Graff","x":"Based on our first half performance and continued ability to manage through a supply-constrained environment, we are once again in a position to raise our guidance for fiscal '26.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/05/ciena-cien-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2026-09-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"In that context, high speed, low latency optical connectivity has become a critical enabler to not only operationalizing the AI driven investment in the network, and the data center but also monetizing those investments over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/ciena-cien-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2026-09-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gary Smith","x":"Co created with the hyperscalers, it dramatically increases the density of existing optical amplifier infrastructure and as such, is purpose built to address the needs to distribute AI training workloads in data centers across greater distances.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/ciena-cien-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2026-09-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Marc D. Graff","x":"We achieved 46.4% adjusted gross this quarter, which was positively impacted by the treatment of tariff refunds by about 70 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/ciena-cien-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2026-09-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Marc D. Graff","x":"Even without the tariff impact, gross margin achieved the top end of guidance, reflecting disciplined cost execution, favorable mix, and pricing discipline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/ciena-cien-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CIEN 2026 Q3","e":"cien","d":"2026-09-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Marc D. Graff","x":"And, yo